{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">姚焯菲（Chantel）即將迎來演藝生涯的重要里程碑——她的首個個人演唱會，《姚焯菲 Chantel 想飛 Live Concert 2026》將於 8 月 29 日（星期六）晚上隆重舉行。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_59a63aa158b871ee-412\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">對於這次首個個人演出，姚焯菲表示非常期待。回首過去，她由當初參加歌唱比賽的小女孩，成長至今日能夠獨當一面，站上屬於自己的舞台。她希望透過這次演唱會，讓大家看到她對音樂的堅持與努力。</p><p id=\"p-rc_59a63aa158b871ee-412\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"02eb775b-9221-4b0c-ad8c-a5d55213afa3.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026aQzgl76TRx1783675506.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"02eb775b-9221-4b0c-ad8c-a5d55213afa3.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"24b1d514-964e-4b1a-bb59-6afc9da88ab4.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026jNmLLOzGq01783675644.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"24b1d514-964e-4b1a-bb59-6afc9da88ab4.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p id=\"p-rc_59a63aa158b871ee-413\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">距離演唱會只剩下不足兩個月，姚焯菲現已全面投入備戰狀態。她正與製作團隊每天緊密聯繫，把握每一分每一秒好好構思及設計演唱會的每一個環節，務求在暑假結束前，帶給粉絲和觀眾一個精彩難忘的演出。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-18T13:18:21.290112+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":280,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}